window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Welcome to the dark and dangerous world of the Society of Secrets! Power. They have it. I don't.<br> <br> Simmering below the surface of Manchester lies a secret underworld where power is currency, and I have none.</i></b><br> <br> Finally being free from years of study at Manchester University, I’m thrust into the high-powered world of investment banking. The game is thrilling, but I find myself distracted by the players…three of them, to be precise. A Viscount’s son, and two wealthy brothers, one of whom is their leader. <br> <br> As I fall even deeper down the rabbit hole, I realize I can't escape. These distractingly handsome men have claimed me, and they are dragging me under the surface of the bustling city into their shady world.<br> <br> Will I resist my dark desires, or will I dive headfirst into this secret society and all the danger it entails?<br> <br> <b>From </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> best-selling author Eve Newton comes your next thrilling romance where the men know how to share! Enter the dazzling shared world of the Society of Secrets, where each book is standalone and doesn't end on a cliffhanger. Scroll up and grab your copy today!</b></p>"; 
